{
 "name": "Nuclear Fallout — each creature gets twice -X/-X",
 "notes": "Diagnosed from the subject probe's open list (memory project_suspected_menace_and_for_each_inert_diagnosis_2026-10-14). With X filled in, the text reads 'Each creature gets twice -2/-2'; boostRegex wants the number straight after 'gets', so the spell made no effect. parseCardEffects (cards-parser.js, after _normalizeWhereXIs) now rewrites 'get(s) twice ±N/±N' to the doubled boost. X = 2: Grizzly Bears 2/2 becomes -2/-2, the opponent's Craw Wurm 6/4 becomes 2/0. The rad counters are not a continuous effect and are not tracked. Memory: project_nuclear_fallout_and_teferis_moat_2026-10-14.",
